#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:16
msgid "Setting up a robot simulation (Gazebo) - tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:19
msgid ""
"Gazebo provides physics-based simulation for testing robot models and "
"environments before using real hardware. This tutorial shows how to install "
"a compatible Gazebo version and verify that it starts correctly. After "
"following it, you will be ready to continue with Gazebo tutorials for "
"building and running simulations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:27
msgid "**Goal:** Launch a Simulation with Gazebo and ROS 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:29
msgid "**Tutorial level:** Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:31
msgid "**Time:** 5 minutes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:36
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Integrations-and-related/Simulators/Gazebo/Gazebo.rst:40
msgid ""
"These instructions are about the current `Gazebo <https://gazebosim.org/>`__ "
"(previously known as Ignition), not  `Gazebo Classic <https://classic."
"gazebosim.org/>`__."
msgstr ""

